## Roles and Visibility

- Roles: ADMIN, SUPER_USER, DOT_USER.
- Admin and Super User can view all DOTs; DOT_USER restricted to their DOT.
- Only Admins see and access the upload section.

## Authentication

- Use secure password hashing and token-based auth.
- Admin and named account passwords must be changeable; Super User password is fixed by policy.
- Provide password reset via Admin action or email workflow.

## Session Management

- Auto-logout after 15 minutes of inactivity on frontend and backend token expiry.

## Input and File Security

- Validate uploaded files (type/size); scan extensions and mime types.
- Store uploads under `uploads/` with safe filenames.
